{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52139","headline":"题半偈舍身山（在西天） · 玄奘","name":"题半偈舍身山（在西天）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽闻八字超诗境，不借丹躯舍此山。\n偈句篇留方石上，乐音时奏半空间。\n（按：《大唐西域记》卷三有《大石门及王子舍身饲虎处》条。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄奘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}